    "body": "## API Gateway Setup\n\n### Overview\nSet up the API Gateway to handle authentication, rate limiting, and routing for all microservices.\n\n### Tasks\n- [ ] Evaluate Kong vs Nginx vs AWS API Gateway\n- [ ] Set up chosen API Gateway locally\n- [ ] Configure service routing rules\n- [ ] Implement JWT validation middleware\n- [ ] Add rate limiting per endpoint\n- [ ] Configure CORS policies\n- [ ] Set up request/response logging\n- [ ] Add health check endpoints\n- [ ] Configure load balancing\n- [ ] Create gateway documentation\n- [ ] Set up monitoring dashboard\n- [ ] Create Docker compose configuration\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- All service endpoints accessible through gateway\n- JWT tokens validated on protected routes\n- Rate limiting prevents abuse\n- Health checks return proper status\n- Logs capture all requests\n- Documentation complete\n\n### Dependencies\n- Identity Service (for JWT validation)\n\n### Estimated Time\n- 1 week\n\n### References\n- [Architecture Doc](ARCHITECTURE.md)\n- [Kong Documentation](https://docs.konghq.com/)",
    "closedAt": null,
    "comments": [
      {
        "id": "IC_kwDOPtvf087cf8vh",
