        "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
        "body": "## 🎉 API Gateway Implementation Status\n\nGreat news! After reviewing the codebase, the API Gateway setup is **essentially complete**. Here's the detailed status:\n\n### ✅ Completed Tasks\n\n| Task | Status | Implementation |\n|------|--------|----------------|\n| Evaluate Kong vs Nginx vs AWS API Gateway | ✅ | Kong selected and configured |\n| Set up chosen API Gateway locally | ✅ | `gateway/kong.yml` + Docker Compose |\n| Configure service routing rules | ✅ | Routes for all 4 services defined |\n| Implement JWT validation middleware | ✅ | JWT plugin configured on protected routes |\n| Add rate limiting per endpoint | ✅ | Different limits per endpoint category |\n| Configure CORS policies | ✅ | Permissive dev config, prod templates ready |\n| Set up request/response logging | ✅ | File-log plugin configured |\n| Add health check endpoints | ✅ | Health checks on all upstream services |\n| Configure load balancing | ✅ | Round-robin with service discovery |\n| Create gateway documentation | ✅ | `gateway/README.md` complete |\n| Create Docker compose configuration | ✅ | Full stack in `docker-compose.yml` |\n\n### ⚠️ Remaining\n| Task | Status | Notes |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| Set up monitoring dashboard | 🔄 | Grafana configured, needs Kong-specific dashboard |\n\n### Key Files\n- `gateway/kong.yml` - Main Kong declarative config\n- `gateway/README.md` - Gateway documentation  \n- `docker-compose.yml` - Full infrastructure including Kong\n\n### Access Points\n- **Proxy**: `http://localhost:8000`\n- **Admin API**: `http://localhost:8001`\n- **Manager GUI**: `http://localhost:8002`\n\n---\n\n**Recommendation**: This issue can be closed once the monitoring dashboard is verified. The core API Gateway functionality is production-ready! 🚀",
