    "body": "## Identity Service Implementation\n\n### Overview\nImplement the foundation service for user authentication and KYC verification.\n\n### Tasks\n- [ ] Set up Node.js/Express project structure\n- [ ] Configure PostgreSQL database with migrations\n- [ ] Implement user registration API\n- [ ] Add JWT authentication\n- [ ] Create login/logout endpoints\n- [ ] Add password hashing with bcrypt\n- [ ] Implement basic KYC document upload\n- [ ] Add biometric authentication stub\n- [ ] Create user profile management APIs\n- [ ] Add multi-language support (en, pcm, yo, fr)\n- [ ] Write unit tests (80% coverage)\n- [ ] Add integration tests\n- [ ] Create Dockerfile\n- [ ] Update OpenAPI documentation\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- Users can register with email/phone\n- Users can login and receive JWT token\n- Users can upload KYC documents\n- All APIs follow OpenAPI spec\n- Tests pass with >80% coverage\n\n### Dependencies\n- None (foundation service)\n\n### Estimated Time\n- 2 weeks\n\n### References\n- [Service README](services/identity-service/README.md)\n- [OpenAPI Spec](services/identity-service/openapi.yaml)\n- [Architecture Doc](ARCHITECTURE.md)",
